    "engagement_mechanic": "Visitors inspect the proof behind each claim before they are asked to book a meeting or accept the AI story.",
    "desired_outcome": "The B Team has a public proof base that paid, earned, shared and sales activity can point to.",
    "targets": "Read proof-page readiness in Month 2, launch-week performance in Month 4 and weekly proof-page behaviour from Month 4 through Month 12.",
